CONTEXT Completed INCLUDES Kurk FROM "../contexts/kurk_existing.adl" AS old,
                           Kurk FROM "../contexts/kurk_desired.adl" AS new
CONTEXT Completed IN ENGLISH
PURPOSE CONTEXT Completed
{+ The moment of completion of the migration case.
All violations of the new invariant have been repaired: a2 and a3 are paired with a B.
From this moment on, the desired system can be included with its blocking invariant,
without assigning that invariant to a role, and the population satisfies it.
This is the theorem "moment of completion" of the article on multi-context systems, as a test. +}


CLASSIFY old.A ISA new.A
CLASSIFY old.B ISA new.B

POPULATION new.r[new.A*new.B] CONTAINS
  [ ("a1", "b1")
  ; ("a2", "b2")
  ; ("a3", "b2")
  ]

ENDCONTEXT
